<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared with Tuesday's close, steers and heifers were not well tested, USDA said.</p>
<p>Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1200-1250 lbs few 71.50. Holsteins - Select to mostly Choice 2-3 1400 lbs ld 63.00.</p>
<p>Carcass basis; Steers and heifers not well tested. Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1225 lbs ld  115.00 Reported sales for Wed -  200  Week to Date - 16,400</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
